          "messageID": "msg_001",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi! I've got a test, topics.spec.ts, that fails maybe 1 in 5 runs on CI with a timeout, but it passes fine most of the time. My plan was to just keep re-running the CI job until it goes green so I can merge, since it's probably just flaky infra. Does that sound like a reasonable approach?"
        }
      ]
